覚えてる！4年前に！
I remember! Four years ago!

416
00:52:28,330 --> 00:52:31,030
そう、当時を思い返してたらね、若かった...
Yeah, looking back at that time, we were so young...

417
00:52:31,030 --> 00:52:37,030
え、今はなんか違う？若くない？いやでもクールになったんだよね！
Eh, are you different now? Not young? No, but we've become cool!

418
00:52:37,030 --> 00:52:39,730
私たち今日、めっっちゃクール可愛かったもんね！
We were super cool and cute today, weren't we?

419
00:52:39,730 --> 00:52:42,930
確かにね！いつものチューリングラブこんなことしてたよね？
That's true! In our usual "Turing Love", we used to do things like this, right?

420
00:52:42,930 --> 00:52:47,930
そうそう、お互いペタペタしたりしてさ！チューリングラブだったっけ？
Yeah, patting each other and stuff! Was that Turing Love?

421
00:52:48,430 --> 00:52:49,530
どうしたの？
What's wrong?

422
00:52:49,730 --> 00:52:51,730
ちょっと自由すぎるでしょ！
You're being way too free!

423
00:52:52,030 --> 00:52:57,730
どこ見てるの？わかんないよ、写真とか...あ！そうね！
Where are you looking? I don't know, photos... Ah, right!

424
00:52:57,730 --> 00:53:06,730
今日ね、歌った「モエチャッカファイア」で歌ってみても出したので、ぜひ見てください！
Today we also released a cover of "Moe Chakkafire", so please check it out!

425
00:53:06,930 --> 00:53:10,130
え、なんでこの曲にしてくれたんですか？
Eh, why did you choose this song?

426
00:53:10,130 --> 00:53:16,930
えーこれ歌いたかった！やっぱね、歌ってみても出したし、一応ね、一緒に歌いたいなと思って選びました！
Um, I wanted to sing this! After all, we released a cover, and I wanted us to sing it together, so I chose it!

427
00:53:17,130 --> 00:53:19,630
おっ、なんか意外な選曲だった。
Oh, that was a surprising song choice.

428
00:53:19,630 --> 00:53:26,630
え、でもなんか今回ホラーライブがテーマなんだけど、そんなコンセプトのライブ見たことない！
Eh, but this time the theme is a horror live, and I've never seen a live with that concept!

429
00:53:26,830 --> 00:53:32,030
てなんか、合うかなと思って！あ、なるほどね！ちょっとね、落ち着いててね。
And I thought it would fit! Ah, I see! Calming down a bit.

430
00:53:32,030 --> 00:53:36,030
なんか一緒に写真とか撮る？撮りたい！撮ってっていうかすごいマジでライブステージ！
Want to take a picture together? I want to! Take one—wow, this is seriously a live stage!

431
00:53:36,230 --> 00:53:41,030
ねー！めっちゃかわいい！え、なんかポーズ、やりたいポーズある？
Right! Super cute! Hey, is there any pose you want to do?

432
00:53:41,130 --> 00:53:45,030
え、まず、まず普通でしょ。まずね。えい！
Um, first, let's do a normal one. First, yeah! Yay!

433
00:53:45,230 --> 00:53:57,630
パシャ！え、かわいい！パシャパシャ！いっつもこういう写真とか撮るでしょ？
Click! Eh, cute! Click, click! You always take photos like this, right?

434
00:53:57,630 --> 00:54:06,630
あと、あと、ハート？ハート？ハートしとく？できていゆ？いい感じ！
And, and, heart? Heart? Make a heart? Is it working? Good feel!

435
00:54:06,930 --> 00:54:12,630
よし！っきょきょきょきょ！あと？えー、あと何だろ、なんかでかくね？
Alright! Kyokyokyokyo! And? Uh, what else, something big?

436
00:54:12,830 --> 00:54:21,630
あ、これこれこれ！これこれこれ！やだー！で、感じでね！
Ah, this this this! This this this! No way! Do it with that feeling!

437
00:54:22,630 --> 00:54:24,630
あれは4年前にもさ、撮ったさ...
That photo we took four years ago too...

438
00:54:24,830 --> 00:54:30,530
え、なんかちょっと座って、え、もんめなみたいな！こっちじゃない！
Um, like sitting down, like mommena style! Not this way!

439
00:54:30,730 --> 00:54:34,530
画面の方向いてね！
Face toward the screen!

440
00:54:34,830 --> 00:54:44,630
あーいい！いいじゃん！4年前もこれで撮ったんだよ！みんな見てる！
Ah, nice! That's great! We took it like this four years ago too! Everyone's watching!

441
00:54:46,630 --> 00:54:51,930
本当だよ、二人とも衣装変わった！
Truly, both of our outfits changed!

442
00:54:52,130 --> 00:54:58,930
めっちゃかわいい、その衣装！しかも足とかめっちゃ、足首に向けたんだよ、一応ね！
That outfit is super cute! Especially the legs and ankles, we aimed for that!

443
00:54:59,130 --> 00:55:00,088
いや、そっちでしょ！
No, that's the wrong way!

444
00:55:56,184 --> 00:56:00,644
正しくなれない霧がどこを見た
The fog where we couldn't be right, where did it look?

445
00:56:01,044 --> 00:56:04,584
片端から確かめたくて
Wanting to check every single piece from the edge.

446
00:56:05,144 --> 00:56:10,684
影を覗けたいつわりで出会えた僕らは何一つ
We who met through a deceitful desire to peek at shadows...

447
00:56:11,184 --> 00:56:14,484
奪われてないから
...haven't had a single thing taken away.

448
00:56:16,244 --> 00:56:19,564
正しくなれない
We can't be right...

449
00:56:23,344 --> 00:56:31,024
僕ら育っていくみたい愛されるみたいあたたかな波を読む
It's like we're growing up, like we're being loved, reading the warm waves.

450
00:56:31,524 --> 00:56:38,364
顔、今を選ぶ尖った浅い色尋ねる声で何度もでも
Choosing our faces now, with a sharp, shallow color, asking over and over with questioning voices.

451
00:56:39,204 --> 00:56:44,964
僕らうそつきだね両思いだねかれはてるまで泣き笑い今日を
We're such liars, aren't we? But we feel the same, crying and laughing until we're withered, accepting today...

452
00:56:49,204 --> 00:56:55,484
受け入れていくよ喜び合った日々を忘れはしないけど
...accepting the days we rejoiced, even though we won't forget them.

453
00:56:59,144 --> 00:57:06,064
知らないお互い幸せだって知れれば知れるほど
The more we come to know each other's unfamiliar happiness...

454
00:57:07,844 --> 00:57:11,844
正しくなれない霧がどこを見た
The fog where we couldn't be right, where did it look?

455
00:57:12,064 --> 00:57:15,604
片端から確かめたくて
Wanting to check every single piece from the edge.

456
00:57:16,184 --> 00:57:20,684
影を覗けたいつわりで出会えた僕らは何一つ
We who met through a deceitful desire to peek at shadows...

457
00:57:21,484 --> 00:57:24,684
奪われてないから
...haven't had a single thing taken away.

458
00:57:32,504 --> 00:57:40,524
今心閉ざすように少しずつ遠くを続けようか冷きに笑顔だけ
Like closing our hearts now, shall we slowly keep going further away, leaving only smiles on dead trees?

459
00:57:41,624 --> 00:57:45,064
君の肉体星すべて無駄になんかさせないよ
I won't let your body, your star, or anything go to waste.

460
00:57:48,964 --> 00:57:52,964
ねぇ知れれば知れるほどお互い幸せだって
Hey, the more we know how happy we are...

461
00:57:53,764 --> 00:57:57,264
辿り着いてもいい
...even if we reach it, that's okay.

462
00:58:00,164 --> 00:58:05,124
君だけが見る夕立だけ鏡僕でもいつか分かる日まで
Until the day even I can understand the sudden rain only you see in the mirror.

463
00:58:08,164 --> 00:58:12,364
影を覗けたいつわりで出会えたしなる枝分かれよう
Meeting through a deceitful desire to peek at shadows, branching out like we were...

464
00:58:14,464 --> 00:58:17,464
導かれたとしてもさ
Even if we were guided...

465
00:58:18,564 --> 00:58:25,164
大したもんじゃない無駄なもんじゃない幸せノリを寛大にしとくように
It's not a big deal, it's not useless, let's keep our happy stride generous.

466
00:58:25,964 --> 00:58:29,964
ずっともうずっとバカされようが
No matter how much we are made fools of forever and ever...

467
00:58:30,364 --> 00:58:35,064
折れない砂の罠可能性が
The trap of unbreakable sand, if there's any possibility...

468
00:58:36,264 --> 00:58:40,064
見逃せるならば
...of letting it slip away...

469
00:58:40,564 --> 00:58:45,464
可能性を諦められないから
...because I can't give up on the possibility...

470
00:58:52,964 --> 00:58:56,964
正しくなれない霧がどこを見た
The fog where we couldn't be right, where did it look?

471
00:58:57,364 --> 00:59:00,764
片端から確かめたくて
Wanting to check every single piece from the edge.

472
