We who met through a deceitful desire to peek at shadows...

473
00:59:06,164 --> 00:59:09,264
奪われてないから
...haven't had a single thing taken away.

474
00:59:09,464 --> 00:59:14,264
すべて嫌われても奪われてないから
Even if everyone hates us, nothing has been taken away.

475
00:59:16,244 --> 00:59:22,604
[Text: はとちゃん 大好きだよ ずっと]
[Text: Haato-chan I love you always]

476
00:59:24,144 --> 00:59:30,724
[Text: はっちゃんも... 私も大好き]
[Text: Hatchan too... I love you too]

477
00:59:31,644 --> 00:59:36,604
[Text: 今まで... ごめんね ごめんなさい]
[Text: Until now... I'm sorry, I'm so sorry]

478
00:59:37,844 --> 00:59:43,744
[Text: いなくなって 寂しかったよ いつもそばにいるって言ったじゃん]
[Text: I was so lonely when you disappeared... You said you'd always be by my side, didn't you?]

479
00:59:48,944 --> 00:59:52,604
[Text: ずっと待ってたよ]
[Text: I've been waiting all this time.]

480
01:02:17,246 --> 01:02:22,596
ねえ見て お気に入りの 世界に一つのお人形さん
Hey, look, my favorite, one-and-only doll in the world.

481
01:02:23,196 --> 01:02:29,346
顔も性格も違ったけど ずっとみんな なかよし
Even though our faces and personalities were different, we've always been good friends.

482
01:02:30,096 --> 01:02:35,896
苦しいを教わったとき 私にもできた恩返し
When I learned what pain was, I was able to return the favor too.

483
01:02:36,596 --> 01:02:47,596
大事な人 好きな人 いつもそばにいてほしい、よね。
Important people, people I love... I always want you by my side, right?

484
01:02:51,596 --> 01:03:00,296
上手に乗っけて私にしてくれたように 少しほつれたこととか
Just like how you placed me so skillfully and made me yours, even if I came a bit unraveled...

485
01:03:00,896 --> 01:03:06,596
めちゃ可愛いね 身体もたくさん
You're so cute, with so much of your body...

486
