顔も性格も違ったけど ずっとみんな なかよし
Even though our faces and personalities were different, we've always been good friends.

490
01:03:49,096 --> 01:03:57,296
なかよし なかよし なかよし なかよし...
Good friends, good friends, good friends, good friends...

491
01:04:10,596 --> 01:04:19,596
やさしい、うれしい、楽しい、いとしい ほめて、なでて
Kind, happy, fun, precious... praise me, stroke me.

492
01:04:19,896 --> 01:04:27,596
ねえ。ねえ。ねえ。ねえ。あぁ。
Hey... Hey... Hey... Hey... Ah...

493
01:04:30,196 --> 01:04:35,896
上手に乗っけて私にしてくれたように 少しほつれたこととか
Just like how you placed me so skillfully and made me yours, even if I came a bit unraveled...

494
